+([BEHAVIOR_RECIPES_PLAN.md](../../../BEHAVIOR_RECIPES_PLAN.md) §6.2) and for
+§9 of [TREX_TAIL_SATURATION_HABIT_2026_10.md](../../TREX_TAIL_SATURATION_HABIT_2026_10.md)
